        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-ATL05F, Contemporary Bling Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe First Impressions Contemporary Bling Appliance Pull are filled with faux diamond shaped crystals and fitted with the contemporary end brackets. Richen your kitchen's appeal by adding bling to your appliances including the freezer and refrigerator. This Bling Refrigerator Pull comes with everything you'll need to install it on a 3/4 inch thick appliance panel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href=\"/products/austrian-crystal-bling-appliance-pull-first-impressions-ap-crs100swvsbr\"> Swarovski Crystals</a> for even more sparkle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the First Impressions Bling Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear Acrylic filled with Glass Crystals</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-ATL05F-specifications.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>First Impressions AP-ATL05F Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-AP-ATL05F012:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-AP-ATL05F018:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-AP-ATL05F024:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 22-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-2/3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions acrylic appliance pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>  \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
